      "type": "event",
      "date": "2026-05-27T16:07:00.000Z",
      "title": "Uni Abex Alloy Products Limited Recommends Special Dividend for the Financial Year 2025-26",
      "body": "The Board of Directors of Uni Abex Alloy Products Limited at their Meeting held on 27 May 2026. Further, the Board of Directors have also recommended a special dividend on account of Thane land sale of INR 60 per share (600%) of face value of INR 10 each. Accordingly, the total dividend recommended by the Board for the Fiscal Year 2025-26 aggregates to INR 100 per share (1000%) of face value of INR 10 each which shall be subject to the approval of shareholders of the Company at the ensuing Annual General Meeting. The date of AGM and record date will be intimated separately.",
      "keyDevTypeId": "94",
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "EventActivity"
    },
    {
      "id": "3e2a83ac-facb-4ca9-83c8-f38c7ede9bbc",
      "type": "event",
      "date": "2026-05-27T16:07:00.000Z",
      "title": "Uni Abex Alloy Products Limited Appoints Nisar Hassan as Chief Executive Officer, Effective from May 27, 2026",
      "body": "The Board of Directors of Uni Abex Alloy Products Limited at their Meeting held on 27 May 2026. Based on the recommendation of the Nomination and Remuneration Committee, the Board elevated Mr. Nisar Hassan, Chief Operating Officer & manager of the Company to the post of Chief Executive Officer with immediate effect. Accordingly, Mr. Nisar Hassan shall cease to be the COO & Manager on being designated as CEO with immediate effect. Mr. Nisar Hassan shall continue as the Key Managerial Personnel of the Company. Mr. Nisar Hassan is a seasoned business leader with over 25 years of diverse experience across B2B, B2C, off-road equipment, hybrid vehicles, metals, energy, engineering, and both SME and global corporate markets. His career spans a wide array of industries, showcasing his adaptability",
      "keyDevTypeId": "101",
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "EventActivity"
    },
